# id|enabled|kind|freq|p1|p2|title|description
# Loaded once at gametype init (server start / map change). Edit then change map.
# freq: every = each time the trigger fires
#       map   = at most once per gametype init / map
#       round = at most once per match playtime (warmup→playtime; not CA/bomb intra-match rounds)
#       once  = lifetime (skip if award_<id> already > 0 on the user file)
# kinds: ping_high, victim_streak, revenge, spec_time, suicide, fast_death,
#        kill_then_die, stillness, manual, kill_streak, first_blood, alive_time
# All duration params are seconds. ping_high: p1=ping threshold, p2=seconds (0 = spike, re-arm when below).
# we_awardGive bypasses frequency. Existing awards.txt from older builds: add a freq column
# (or leave 4th field empty/numeric for legacy every). Convert old ms values: 5000→5, 3000→3.
lag_lord|1|ping_high|every|100|60|Lag Lord|Held ping over 100 for 60 seconds
dialup_diplomat|1|ping_high|round|250|0|Dial-up Diplomat|Ping spiked past 250
punching_bag|1|victim_streak|map|5|0|Punching Bag|Same player killed you 5 times in a row
the_student|1|revenge|map|3|0|The Student|Killed the player who got 3 consecutive kills on you
couch_potato|1|spec_time|map|180|0|Couch Potato|Spectated for 3 minutes
own_goal|1|suicide|round|1|0|Own Goal Enthusiast|You did that to yourself
spawn_tourist|1|fast_death|round|5|0|Spawn Tourist|Died within 5 seconds of spawning
glass_cannon|1|kill_then_die|every|3|0|Glass Cannon|Got a kill then died within 3 seconds
living_statue|1|stillness|map|30|0|Living Statue|Stood still while alive for 30 seconds
on_a_roll|1|kill_streak|round|5|0|On a Roll|5 kills without dying
first_blood|1|first_blood|round|0|0|First Blood|First kill of the match
survivor|1|alive_time|once|120|0|Survivor|Stayed alive for 2 minutes after spawning
participation|1|manual|every|0|0|Participation Trophy|Granted by an operator
